<title>SINGAPORE: Asiamatrix asks SES to suspend shares.</title>
<headline>Asiamatrix asks SES to suspend shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asiamatrix Ltd said on Friday it had asked the Stock Exchange of Singapore to suspend trading of its shares with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Asiamatrix said the suspension was requested until further notice pending an announcement.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
